OL,5,G0400 My Week With Maggi Hambling
OL,6,     FIn this brand-new encounter with
OL,7,     Fone of our greatest living
OL,8,     Fartists, art historian and curator
OL,9,     FKate Bryan immerses herself in
OL,10,     Ficon Maggi Hambling's life and
OL,11,     Fwork.
OL,12,G0500 The Art Of Film
OL,13,     FComedy, Parody, Satire and Laughs:
OL,14,     FAs long as there have been
OL,15,     Fperforming arts, there has been
OL,16,     Fcomedy. But different approaches
OL,17,     Fhave evolved from the silent era
OL,18,     Fonwards. (S1, ep 5)
